    "content" : "Theymet attheBerghof, Hitler’smansion highinthe Bavarian Alps.Overthecourse oftheday,Hitlerthrewa masterclassinintimidation. ToplaceVonSchuschniggoff balance,theFühreralternated betweenthreatsand friendly overtures,whilekeeping him waitingonand offfor hours. Eventually,vonSchuschnigg cavedinandsignedan agreement whichpavedthe way fortheNazitakeoverofAustria."
