    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "Sooften,historyisaboutthe consequencesofmistakesby theweak andfallible.Ifthe performanceofour Brexit negotiatorsappearsdubious, that issmallbeercompared withthe cravendealingsduringthekey meetings–allstill within living memory–which couldhave preventedthe Second World War. Inthis slim, disturbing volume theFrenchwriterandﬁlm directorÉric Vuillardrecreates some ofthem with striking imaginativeﬂair."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 7,
