    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "When AnnWroewantedto write abiographyofStFrancis ofAssisi,shedecideditwasalife bestexpressed inpoetry. Andso comes aboutthestructureofthis extraordinarybook. Shestarts eachchapterwithanextract fromabiographyofStFrancis andperhaps apassagefrom Francis himself.Then shefollows it withapoemabout theepisode, andfollowsthatwith afurther poem about alooselylinked contemporary subject."
  }, {
