    "content" : "Vuillardexploresthethoughts andfeelingsofhisprotagonists withnimblefacilityinthis tour deforceofenhancedrealism.It isnosurprisethatit isaprizewinning best-seller inFrance– thoughwhetherthe industrialists and politicians ofthepresent everlearnmuch fromtheir predecessors’mistakesismoot. AsVuillardsays: “Weneverfall twiceinto thesameabyss.Butwe alwaysfallinthesameway,ina mixtureofridiculeanddread.”"
